                        ],
                        "form": "nestoriens"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "6fb87aa9-c9d4-47cb-a96b-f4f4ba913c8d",
                        "entry_id": "7c47e9e8-0fe1-37b5-94d2-7e77a9a249a3",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "nestorienne"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f4dcff81-ebc9-4cbc-8382-d3ea9b324d12",
                        "entry_id": "7c47e9e8-0fe1-37b5-94d2-7e77a9a249a3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "nestoriennes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9fdfdbdc-4d79-30ca-900e-c629d866c3ae",
                        "entry_id": "7c47e9e8-0fe1-37b5-94d2-7e77a9a249a3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif au nestorianisme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "da445216-214e-4d9f-b88a-fc539ac07837",
                                "sense_id": "9fdfdbdc-4d79-30ca-900e-c629d866c3ae",
                                "text": "Le rituel se répète vingt, trente fois, tandis que les délégations défilent. Elles représentent les quartiers de la ville, notamment Asfizar, Panjkhin, Zagrimaéh, Maturid, les corporations des bazars et celles des métiers, chaudronniers, papetiers, sériciculteurs ou porteurs d’eau, ainsi que les communautés protégées, juifs, guèbres et chrétiens nestoriens."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "feedf6eb-a595-4ca0-8d28-2463223d29b9",
                                "sense_id": "9fdfdbdc-4d79-30ca-900e-c629d866c3ae",
                                "text": "À Éphèse, les premières grosses chaleurs estivales échauffent les esprits. Dans les églises, dans les rues, sur les places publiques, évêques, prêtres et moines, nestoriens et cyrilliens se prennent à partie et s'invectivent en termes crus. La situation devient intenable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eea40dea-1a86-4954-8e20-b1df16537e3a",
                                "sense_id": "9fdfdbdc-4d79-30ca-900e-c629d866c3ae",
                                "text": "La majorité des textes en sogdien retrouvés à Tourfan et à Dunhuang datent des VIIIᵉ-IVᵉ siècles et sont religieux : bouddhiques (souvent traduits du chinois), chrétiens nestoriens et manichéens."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bda27045-938b-4e79-8d1c-cab41d4ec8ef",
                        "source_entry_id": "7c47e9e8-0fe1-37b5-94d2-7e77a9a249a3",
                        "source_sense_id": "9fdfdbdc-4d79-30ca-900e-c629d866c3ae",
                        "target_lang_word": "Nestorian",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Nestorian",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "55d8a325-2cdf-328a-b7f6-d665e937eb56",
                                        "entry_id": "e41ebd5a-348e-3a52-a991-1107df1388d7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to teachings or to the followers of Nestorius."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff9e71da-a69a-42b9-afcf-94b5f8236583",
                                                "sense_id": "55d8a325-2cdf-328a-b7f6-d665e937eb56",
                                                "text": "A Nestorian stele, dated 781AD, was discovered in 1625 near Chang'an."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "908d3b85-4199-4c08-85b6-d750ee76504e",
                                                "sense_id": "55d8a325-2cdf-328a-b7f6-d665e937eb56",
                                                "text": "Through them passed not only the traders of the Silk Route[…] but also lone Buddhist monks carrying precious cargoes of scrolls in their backpacks, white-robed Manichean sages from Iran and austere Nestorian clerics who founded Christian monasteries even in remote Tibet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Nestorian",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3515838-2bbc-3c5d-b420-5d9ff01f0860",
                                        "entry_id": "c5f202c8-f37c-3f54-a599-c2cc53ec5d51",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A perceived follower of Nestorius in the fourth and fifth centuries. A member of a Nestorian church."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ddd63831-9bba-4e90-a412-95dde108a0a5",
                                                "sense_id": "b3515838-2bbc-3c5d-b420-5d9ff01f0860",
                                                "text": "After his return he bitterly complained of being called a Nestorian by the Monophysite Philoxenus, declaring that he \"knew nothing\" of Nestorius."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "39f3e32d-a7cb-4e58-aede-f2dd959496d3",
                        "source_entry_id": "7c47e9e8-0fe1-37b5-94d2-7e77a9a249a3",
